<title>USA: U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.37018.</title>
<headline>U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.37018.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Monetary Fund said the exchange value of the U.S. dollar against the SDR was 1.37018, versus 1.37195 yesterday and 1.20635 on July 1, 1974.</p>
<p>Other currency values against the SDR today (July 1, 1974 rates in parentheses) were.</p>
<p> Deutsche Mark     2.34808   (3.06809)</p>
<p> French Franc	7.92307   (5.82126)</p>
<p> Japanese Yen	173.122   (343.773)</p>
<p> Pounds Sterling   0.838646   (0.505474)</p>
<p> Australian Dlr    1.76229   (0.809889)</p>
<p> Aust Schilling    16.5340   (22.0097)</p>
<p> Belgian Franc     48.4667   (45.9249)</p>
<p> Canadian Dlr	1.91003   (1.16295)</p>
<p> Danish Kroner     8.95139   (7.23304)</p>
<p> Indonesian Rupiah 3313.10   (501.291)</p>
<p> Iranian Rial	2404.34   (81.6734)</p>
<p> Italian Lire	2339.98   (779.746)</p>
<p> Kuwait Dinar	0.416274   (0.351685)</p>
<p> Dutch Guilder     2.64212   (3.20316)</p>
<p> Norwegian Kroner  9.64812   (6.59386)</p>
<p> Saudi Arab Riyal  5.13132   (4.25788)</p>
